   322→- DO NOT render any words or letters on the clothing items or background
   323→- The image should contain ONLY the visual representation of the clothing items
   324→- Each item should be clearly visible and properly sized relative to each other
   325→- Items should be laid out in an organized, aesthetically pleasing arrangement
   326→- Pure white background with no text or overlays
   327→- Professional product photography quality
   328→- Sharp focus on all items
   329→- Accurate color representation
   330→- High-end fashion editorial style
   331→- Items should not overlap
   332→
   333→COMPOSITION:
   334→- Square format (1:1 aspect ratio)
   335→- Flat-lay perspective (top-down view)
   336→- Balanced spacing between items
   337→- Elegant, minimalist styling
   338→- NO TEXT OR LABELS ANYWHERE IN THE IMAGE
   339→`.trim();
   340→
   341→    return prompt;
   342→  }
